@base = http://localhost:8082
@user = alice
@password = demo-pass

### Current identity
GET {{base}}/api/me
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}

### Main workflow action
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Authorization: Basic {{user}} {{password}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 1,
  "requestKey": "demo-order-001",
  "payment": "success"
}

### Health
GET {{base}}/actuator/health
